  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-10T11:53:53-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 10, 2018, 11:53 am\">July 10, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p><img src=\"/media/archive/0204c0569ef7888a13c7830e614051b02bdf729b017c0ec15dd72c5a79191e7f.png\" class=\"wp-image-2911 aligncenter size-full\" height=\"325\" alt=\"\" width=\"441\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<h3 class=\"font-headlines\">Sacrifice Art Sale Hosted by The Guild of Harwich Artists, Saturday, July 21, 9 – 12 pm, Harwich Community Center</h3>\n<p>Everything will be priced at $199 or less</p>\n<p>Possible items include:<br />\noriginals – framed or unframed<br />\nreproductions including: prints, cards, tiles, other 3-dimensional objects<br />\nphotographs<br />\nframes<br />\nart supplies<br />\nart books</p>\n<p>The members will be selling their excess paintings and art supplies at greatly reduced prices. Half of the proceeds will benefit the Guild’s charitable giving.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/100+Oak+St,+Harwich,+MA+02645/@41.6922593,-70.0729671,16.95z/data=!4m13!1m7!3m6!1s0x89fb3fc8828c3c1f:0x18b467f600a542b0!2s100+Oak+St,+Harwich,+MA+02645!3b1!8m2!3d41.6922681!4d-70.0706896!3m4!1s0x89fb3fc8828c3c1f:0x18b467f600a542b0!8m2!3d41.6922681!4d-70.0706896\">Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich, MA 02645</a></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
